# Woven link: 12 tube strands basket-woven over a torus of major radius 2.2 and minor
# radius 0.8, built by the same construction as argent_weave.obj at a coarser count --
# two families of 6 strands running v = +u + phi and v = -u + psi, displaced along the
# surface normal by +-0.24*cos(6u) so the crossings interlace.
#
# Sized to be scattered as instances, so it is chunkier than the hero: tube radius 0.15
# against a closest strand approach of 0.3554, and an eight-sided cross section rather than a
# twelve-sided one, which holds up at the few dozen pixels an instance actually covers.
#
# Vertex normals are exact canal-surface normals; the sweep frame is rotation-minimising
# and closed over the loop.
#
# 19200 triangles from 19200 faces, 9600 vertices.
# Object space spans [-3.3900, 3.3900] on X, [-1.1889, 1.1895] on Y, [-3.2598, 3.2595] on Z.

